From: SteamOS ARM port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8550: add the pcieport0 label

Linux 7.4 already has the PCIe root port nodes (and moves the PHY into
them), labelled pcie0_port0. The board dts files reference the
root port as pcieport0, so give the node both labels.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
@@ -2484,7 +2484,7 @@
 				};
 			};
 
-			pcie0_port0: pcie@0 {
+			pcie0_port0: pcieport0: pcie@0 {
 				device_type = "pci";
 				reg = <0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0>;
 				bus-range = <0x01 0xff>;
